Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.90,0:01:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是北緯號　現正在交戰中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:40.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請求支援
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.10,0:01:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:01:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露露  滑溜溜的 　不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.40,0:02:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露露
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃我一炮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.90,0:02:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.60,0:02:15.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這怪物是什么東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,EMERGENCY  EMERGENCY  EMERGENCY...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:23.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出口...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走  露露
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓開  拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉  快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:47.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都濕透了呢  拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露露你也是哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙到底是什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.30,0:03:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一話  火箭 直升機 地下拳擊與我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:04:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個那個  這裡到底是哪兒啊  拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個這個  應該是在日本的某個地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二子魂川?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是先有蛋還是先有雞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:16.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是誰命名的二子魂川
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.40,0:04:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是由於附近居民多是雙胞胎而來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.10,0:04:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者是  來源於二子魂川的城市名稱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精子和卵子相遇後
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生了什么不可思議的奇跡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.90,0:04:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些問題的答案我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一清楚的是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"笑瞇瞇金融"這個名字的來由
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,並不是因为職員都是微笑迎客
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是因为收取了相當高的利息而喜不自禁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.40,0:04:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也許這不會錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝對不是什么正經買賣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:55.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是現在的我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雙葉戀太郎 二十一歲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.50,0:04:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,職業私家偵探
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.90,0:05:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我現在的狀況...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,招待我的是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,櫻月善二 七十二歲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,職業社長  也可以说是幫派老大
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三十年前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當時我也真没用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也只有用這種方式來對一個女人死心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.10,0:05:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不值得一提
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,殺...殺了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父親和我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.90,0:05:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各自有著不同的想法  連命都差點丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一隻手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.80,0:05:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給那不務正業的傢伙也算添了面子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.50,0:05:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然有這樣一個了不起的兒子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:50.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在想來都覺得很不錯  一直都很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.80,0:05:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再開口小心我殺了你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對...對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了好了　算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:06:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣不是也很方便嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.20,0:06:13.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長  社長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雙葉戀太郎  二十一歲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,職業私家偵探
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,處於極度危機
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要说为什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經是三週年忌日了啊 真快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山田間黑  二十三歲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,職業　"笑瞇瞇金融"營業部部長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是廣域暴力集團櫻月組的二當家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.20,0:06:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失去了一個值得珍惜的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多謝您惦記.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是兩小時前的我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:52.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓社長專程到來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咖啡　可以再續杯　請盡情享用
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:06:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父親真是少有的男人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:06.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連我們的社長也器重他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.60,0:07:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要承繼他的話  就要做得更好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道嗎  第二代
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話说回來　關於小P  還真是辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[小P:有什么要抱怨的嗎]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.90,0:07:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  把它寄放在你這裡的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可要向社長保密啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.50,0:07:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然在旅行的時候由我負責在家照顧它
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但它總是在不適當的時候叫嚷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.30,0:07:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[喂 我要吃飯]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全睡不了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.40,0:07:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然這樣说　但誰叫社長疼愛它這也没辦法  對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要吃煎餅嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.30,0:07:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 小P在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  它在哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别開玩笑了  别開玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下可糟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  開什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:03.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎  那個第二代
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三人吃300日元左右的晚餐到底算怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有這么可愛的女生在身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:13.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不　是因为喜歡才幫忙做的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實在是太可愛了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多送你3個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊　謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.30,0:08:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的聲音  難道...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:26.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  日高電視台
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.50,0:08:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是今天採訪嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上不是打過電話了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.50,0:08:32.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  我馬上就出來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.90,0:08:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...  還好吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:43.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受不了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要被殺了　要被殺了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.70,0:08:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經受不了了　受不了了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.80,0:08:50.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别叫的這么悲慘
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:53.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能找警察嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行　不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.60,0:08:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連我也會被抓起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:08:59.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好　我接受
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.00,0:09:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信奉義理和人情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,專門替人解决困難
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我們雙葉偵探事務所
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白鐘沙羅
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:12.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十五歲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,職業：女高中生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自稱雙葉偵探事務所助手一號
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那...那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是個助手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詳細的事情是所長和另一個助手合作負責的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:24.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙羅沙羅  白鐘沙羅
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偵探事務所引以为傲的美女之一
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了  找到了...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.10,0:09:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在幹什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正在...  這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我一起從二樓的窗户跳下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  真高興啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.70,0:09:49.80,Default1,NTP,0,0,0,,[正在勸说金先生(34)  請稍等]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:48.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,僅僅是跳下去而已吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:50.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害怕...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想被抓起來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想被處刊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:09:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.60,0:10:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么時候用繩子把我們連起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:06.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  跳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  真冷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:14.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,性格固執的助手一號
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.70,0:10:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且绝對是心無雜念
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿玄  機車借來用一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下　看到我的内褲了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,順便提一下  這個人是阿玄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休想逃  他們在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:39.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賭上邪道的驕傲一定要殺了他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:43.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大  那邊好像有種奇怪的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:45.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寫著日語...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[雙葉偵探事務所  謹制  自爆裝置]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有很大的聲響
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:11:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還冒煙了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木下  二十六歲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:10.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,職業  二子魂川市的巡察
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了...當我没说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.60,0:11:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快快快快
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:19.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是那個女孩真的很可愛...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少現場直播...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  炒魷魚?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然就賣到澳門去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:28.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.90,0:11:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起啊...  要是我没有燒傷的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.60,0:11:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杉作的嬸嬸阿滿  三十六歲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.80,0:11:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,職業：杉作食品的社長
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兼二子魂川商店協會的會長
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.50,0:11:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主播真的會被賣去澳門嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會去那裡觀光順便玩玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝  我會盡力服務的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個烤薯餅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:03.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面的表皮很鬆脆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裡面的餡鬆鬆軟軟的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.10,0:12:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白鐘雙樹  十五歲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.70,0:12:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,職業：女高中生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自稱雙葉偵探事務所助手二號
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受不了了  接接接接
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:21.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没法接
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這種速度很快就會被追上來了的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  你給我閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連這點都忍受不了就不管你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太過分了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:50.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:52.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,針山西森  二十九歲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:55.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,職業  二子魂川市的巡察
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别名：DIRTY　HARRY
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.90,0:12:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是...是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撞死他  撞死他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這...這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過還是没人接
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.80,0:13:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豆腐店阿玄的機車
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要你慢慢補償過來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:19.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要小看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.90,0:13:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.60,0:13:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没面子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白色的...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二當家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是開玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超認真
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受榮譽的影響  這裡的收益相當不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.70,0:13:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能繳納税金的部分與其借錢不如用這種方式解决更好些
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:52.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好　好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:04.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然看上去是以賭博的形式進行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實也算是一種秀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秀?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要向我挑戰  讓我一拳揍扁你  混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,殘酷秀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:15.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是奇跡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,電視前的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.60,0:14:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在我們來到現場
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:24.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個蛋糕聚會
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:28.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家也請快點  品嚐一下今天奇跡的味道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你久等了  你要的奶油巧克力蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.80,0:14:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂  這裡是杉作食品店
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.90,0:14:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  現在不能外送...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.20,0:14:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你久等了  請問要什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就没有我出場的餘地了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.10,0:14:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  看來生意很不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看吧  大排長龍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.30,0:14:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前輩  會不會變糟啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?  巡邏車...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,SPEAK LOUDER
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們擅自改造它...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.10,0:14:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被發現的話一定會挨批的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.20,0:15:02.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽見没有　給我停下來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好還是停下來哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:10.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙羅小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.30,0:15:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是说停下來比較好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道  真囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.30,0:15:19.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决不能停
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:23.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要亂來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雙樹也聯絡不上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在這裡拚命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家到底在哪裡幹什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要咖喱可麗餅和奶油可麗餅吧  謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:16:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個　真的不能放過我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.30,0:16:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還是放棄吧　你好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二代
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不替小P報復一下的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不覺得它很可憐嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.70,0:16:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對…對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給你點忠告
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小子很强哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:17.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说實話真的很强
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是  他一次也没有在三回合内打敗過對手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:24.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道他的拳頭力量不够嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.70,0:16:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了讓觀众盡興而已
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣　對著那傢伙竖起中指
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話第一回合就結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會被殺的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.90,0:16:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要被慢慢折磨死還是要被一擊打死  你選擇哪個呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一回合
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.40,0:16:42.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等...等...等...等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:47.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是真的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真...真纏人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你會用手機嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.10,0:16:53.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會..會用
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用GPS  找出戀太郎的所在地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我雖然在十八歲時就開始打架了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二代　中指  中指  中指  中指啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中指
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竖不起來啊  中指...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.30,0:17:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等　等等　等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么　這人群是怎么回事啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢　那不是沙羅嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是阿玄的機車嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.90,0:17:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對對　是安裝有SUPER BOOST...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.40,0:17:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太誇張了點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.30,0:17:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閃開  閃開  閃開
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:38.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:43.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙羅
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快追上去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下　也請帶上我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.10,0:17:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊　不要來  不要來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.70,0:17:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了　SUPER BOOST
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.80,0:18:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,MASTER THREE 呼叫總部
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:06.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擊中敵人　現在返航
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇…奇跡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇跡什么的　是要靠自己創造的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.40,0:18:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但現在該怎么辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長連這種狀況也能擺平嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然　因为他是我和雙樹的戀太郎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要跟著那架直升飛機就可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉　提出這種無理的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要介意　這可是頭條哦　頭條
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:37.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話说回來　那個戀太郎究竟哪裡好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:43.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人很善良　没什么生活能力  很愛抽煙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.70,0:18:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大學中途退學  而且名字也很古怪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不會被騙了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.90,0:18:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然是窮鬼一個　又常常糊里糊塗的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是　該出手的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.10,0:18:56.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就會出手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:58.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,適可而止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這算是報復嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2千萬啊  2千萬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,負起責任來　白癡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.40,0:19:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.70,0:19:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.00,0:19:37.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹掉他們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是針山和木下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,READY  FIRE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.10,0:19:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,記者小姐　請快一點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:19:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:03.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考慮一下過去和老爸的交情吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:03.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少廢話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.30,0:20:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今　怎么可能放過你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.40,0:20:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,組長...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:10.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思了　第二代
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.60,0:20:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.40,0:20:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了　沙羅
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.30,0:20:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底發生了什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.90,0:20:32.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這些傢伙是誰?  知道我是邪道嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么邪道不邪道的我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨隨便便就飛進來  别以为簡簡單單就可以了結了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.10,0:20:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋　你們這些小嘍嘍  只要把你們都抓起來就可以了 别小看國家警察了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.80,0:20:58.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們在幹什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.60,0:21:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙...沙羅
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:07.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我要問你的才對
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在這裡幹什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你問幹什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BOXING吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平時告訴過你　我的電話一定要接
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托你的福　我跑遍了整個城鎮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.40,0:21:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙羅  戀太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.10,0:21:21.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,頭條  頭條  要拍下來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雙樹?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是雙樹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.50,0:21:28.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你會在這裡的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.30,0:21:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像事情變得很嚴重了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:35.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底發生了什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.90,0:21:39.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我整理一下信息
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.30,0:21:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃可麗餅嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡在誰?我是哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.80,0:21:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.10,0:21:52.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽说雙方的對峙持續了3個小時
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.90,0:22:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎各處都不得不重新裝修了　沙羅
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:09.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是挺好的嘛 　整修後重新開張
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又不是彈珠店
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.50,0:22:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次不准安裝自爆裝置
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是　那個時候也是没有辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.20,0:22:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是在責怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.30,0:22:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然有可疑的人闖進來...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.10,0:22:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以没怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.90,0:22:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.40,0:22:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙羅也在拚命工作...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.80,0:22:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫雙葉戀太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.20,0:22:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,年齡21歲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.80,0:22:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,職業：私家偵探
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身邊有兩位女助手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.40,0:22:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天大鬧一場後事物所被破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.30,0:22:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛　又不是放棄了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.70,0:23:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們雖然是兩個人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是三個人的話感覺會更好吧
